================================================================================
ACCY V2 — MULTI-OEM PIPELINE ARCHITECTURE PLAN
================================================================================

PURPOSE
-------
This document defines the architecture for the v2 project structure. The goal
is a scalable, consistent framework where:

  - Every OEM has its own self-contained pipeline folder.
  - All OEM pipelines share the same set of core helpers.
  - Each OEM defines its own config file following a standard schema.
  - Adding a new OEM means creating one config file and one pipeline folder —
    no changes to shared code required (unless a new shared capability is needed).
  - The pipeline contract (what steps exist and what they accept/return) is
    consistent across all OEMs, even if the internal logic of a step differs.


